                <note rend="inline" type="source">462.11L5232/571: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Germany</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Mayer</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-05-13T19:00:00-04:00">May 13, 1936—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>51. Your 143, May 12, 5 p.m. Department approves your action and considers that
                    no further action by you is called for. Commission is now hearing arguments.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
